      "metaTitle": "About | Zero Design Studio: A Multidisciplinary Experience Design Company",
      "metaDescription": "Zero Design Studio is a multidisciplinary experience design company in India, the UAE and Saudi Arabia, transforming concepts into extraordinary realities through content, production and bold storytelling.",
